Browse the web with Chromium, minus Google's web services

ungoogled-chromium is Google Chromium without its dependency on Google web services. It keeps the default Chromium experience as closely as possible, so it works as a drop-in replacement, and adds tweaks for privacy, control and transparency that you can turn on when you want them.

- Removes background requests to Google and other web services
- Removes code specific to Google web services
- Replaces pre-made binaries in the source code with ones built from source where possible
- Optional privacy and control settings, off by default
